<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/claim-gap-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>RCV vs. ACV Depreciation and Holdback Calculator</h1><p class="lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay twice: an actual cash value check now and recoverable depreciation once repairs are finished. List your items to see the split.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>RCV / ACV holdback calculator</span><i>Add or remove line items</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="table-wrap items-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Replacement cost ($)</th><th>Age (yrs)</th><th>Life (yrs)</th><th>ACV</th><th><span class="sr-only">Remove</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><input name="item" value="Laminated shingle roof" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="16800" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="11" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="30" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Vinyl siding — two elevations" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="6400" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="14" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="35" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Basement carpet and pad" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="2900" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="7" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="10" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-add data-run>+ Add a line item</button></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="d-ded">Deductible ($)</label><input id="d-ded" name="deduct" inputmode="decimal" value="1500"></div>
        <div><label for="d-cap">Depreciation cap</label><select id="d-cap" name="cap"><option value="50">50%</option><option value="70">70%</option><option value="80" selected>80%</option><option value="90">90%</option></select><span class="hint">Many estimates cap depreciation; check yours.</span></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="nonrec"> My policy pays actual cash value only (no recoverable depreciation)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out tool-out-3" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>First check (ACV − deductible)</small><b data-o="first">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Held back until repairs are done</small><b data-o="held">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Total if fully recovered</small><b data-o="total">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-rows span-all">
        <div><span>Replacement cost (RCV)</span><b data-o="rcv">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Total depreciation</span><b data-o="dep">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Depreciation as a share of RCV</span><b data-o="deppct">0%</b></div>
        <div><span>Actual cash value (ACV)</span><b data-o="acv">$0</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How depreciation is figured here</h2>
<p>The calculator uses straight-line depreciation, age divided by expected life, capped at the percentage you pick. Real estimates may adjust for condition, use different lifespans or treat some items as non-depreciable, so treat the result as a planning figure.</p>
<h2>Lifespans often used in estimates</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Common range</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Three-tab shingles</th><td>20–25 years</td></tr><tr><th>Laminated (architectural) shingles</th><td>25–30 years</td></tr><tr><th>Vinyl siding</th><td>30–40 years</td></tr><tr><th>Interior paint</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Carpet and pad</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Water heater</th><td>10–15 years</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Getting the holdback released</h2>
<p>Most policies pay recoverable depreciation after repairs are completed within a set period. Send invoices and photos of the finished work, and use the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a> so the window doesn’t close on you.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can labor be depreciated in Indiana?</summary><div class="a"><p>Practices differ by policy and carrier, and the question has been litigated in several states. Ask your carrier to explain in writing how labor was treated, and talk to an attorney if it matters to your claim.</p></div></details><details><summary>What happens if I don’t repair?</summary><div class="a"><p>Under most replacement cost policies you keep the ACV payment but may not recover the depreciation that was held back.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</span></a><a href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Percentage Deductible Calculator</span></a><a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><small>Planner</small><span>Claim Timeline Builder</span></a></div></article><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sticky"><div class="side-box call-box"><p class="side-h">Talk it through</p><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="call-num" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="side-box"><p class="side-h">All claim tools</p><ul class="side-list"><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/">Claim Gap &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/" aria-current="page">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/">Percentage Deductible Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">Claim Timeline Builder</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/">Roof Snow Load Estimator</a></li></ul></div></div></aside></div><section class="cta-band"><div class="checker thin" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
